# Browser-session scratch
/.playwright-mcp/
# Review screenshots get dropped at the repo root and never belong in a commit,
# but each one used to be ignored by name, so every new capture re-dirtied the
# tree until someone noticed and added another line. Nothing tracked is an image
# at the root -- real assets live under frontend/public, docs, and ios -- so
# anchoring the pattern here catches the next one without hiding a real asset.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

# GitLab CI job caches. GitLab only archives cache paths under CI_PROJECT_DIR,
# so npm and uv are pointed inside the repo rather than at their defaults in
# $HOME. A restored cache would otherwise show up as untracked files and make
# release-audit report an uncommitted working tree on every run.
/.npm/
/.uv-cache/
/.uv-python/
# Emitted by route-navigation-smoke and compose-workbench-smoke as failure
# artifacts; *.log already covers them, listed here so their origin is obvious.
/api.log
/vite.log
/compose.log
